name zhlineskip
category Package
revision 51142
shortdesc Line spacing for CJK documents
longdesc This package supports typesetting CJK documents. It allows
longdesc users to specify the two ratios between the leading and the
longdesc font size of the body text and the footnote text. For CJK
longdesc typesetting, these ratios usually range from 1.5 to 1.67. This
longdesc package is also capable of restoring the math leading to that
longdesc of the Latin text (usually 1.2 times the font size). Finally,
longdesc it is possible to achieve the Microsoft Word multiple line
longdesc spacing style using zhlineskip.
